    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis is ðonne seo woruldcunde gerædnysse ðe ic wille, mid minan witenan ræde, þæt man healde ofer eall Englaland.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">This is further the secular ordinance which, by the advice of my councillors, I desire should be observed over all England.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Þis is seo woruldcunde gerædnes, ðe ic wylle, mid minan witenan ræde, þæt man healde ofer eall Englaland.</ab>
      </div>
